Guided Anytime is a Python/DLS research variant, not execution of the official IKLink Rust solver. Upstream paper: Wang and Gleicher, Anytime Planning for End-Effector Trajectory Tracking (RA-L 2025); reference source IKLink anytime commit ee5a469cbaf0927b914f8206642e343602e793cc.

